---
title: Seated Deep Shoulder Stretch
type: docs
prev: docs/rastyazhka/
---
![глубокая растяжка плеч сидя](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4c5550ce-153b-4661-803c-b6540d5cef1c)

{{% steps %}}

### Step 1
Sit on the floor, bend your knees with your feet flat on the ground, and place your palms on the floor behind you.

### Step 2
Open your chest, gently arch your back, and let your head relax slightly back.

### Step 3
Keep your chest lifted up rather than slumping down, feeling a deep stretch across your shoulders, chest, and arms.

### Step 4
Hold this position for the recommended amount of time (usually 15–30 seconds).

{{% /steps %}}

{{< callout type="info" >}}
• Try to keep the target muscles relaxed during the stretch.

• Breathe slowly and steadily.

• Do not force the stretch—stretch only until you feel comfortable tension, never sharp pain.
{{< /callout >}}
